[en.CHARACTER_BORI_NAME]
Bori

[en.CHARACTER_BORI_DESC]
We’ve all suffered loss.
And the question that we each struggle with is how do we live with our own survival. How do we make use of this life that we still have.
We must learn to embrace the new roles that fate has handed us.

[zh.CHARACTER_BORI_NAME]
波莉

[zh.CHARACTER_BORI_DESC]
我们都有所失去。
我们都在纠结的问题，就是我们该如何度过幸存下来的生命，我们该如何利用余下的生命。
我们必须学会接受命运交予我们的新角色。
